    * `:alias_name_source` (string) — Source to use when deriving the Alias name. valid choices: "serviceaccount_uid" : <token.uid> e.g. 474b11b5-0f20-4f9d-8ca5-65715ab325e0 (most secure choice) "serviceaccount_name" : <namespace>/<serviceaccount> e.g. vault/vault-agent default: "serviceaccount_uid" Defaults to `"serviceaccount_uid"`.
