    * `:token_explicit_max_ttl` (seconds) — If set, tokens created via this role carry an explicit maximum TTL. During renewal, the current maximum TTL values of the role and the mount are not checked for changes, and any updates to these values will have no effect on the token being renewed.
    * `:token_max_ttl` (seconds) — The maximum lifetime of the generated token
